count-integrity systems with Instagram and reports restrictions inside the app.</p></div></div><ol class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"rounded border border-[#313131] bg-[#181818] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-400\">0<!-- -->1</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-zinc-500\"><path d=\"M128,76a52,52,0,1,0,52,52A52.06,52.06,0,0,0,128,76Zm0,80a28,28,0,1,1,28-28A28,28,0,0,1,128,156Zm113.86-49.57A12,12,0,0,0,236,98.34L208.21,82.49l-.11-31.31a12,12,0,0,0-4.25-9.12,116,116,0,0,0-38-21.41,12,12,0,0,0-9.68.89L128,37.27,99.83,21.53a12,12,0,0,0-9.7-.9,116.06,116.06,0,0,0-38,21.47,12,12,0,0,0-4.24,9.1l-.14,31.34L20,98.35a12,12,0,0,0-5.85,8.11,110.7,110.7,0,0,0,0,43.11A12,12,0,0,0,20,157.66l27.82,15.85.11,31.31a12,12,0,0,0,4.25,9.12,116,116,0,0,0,38,21.41,12,12,0,0,0,9.68-.89L128,218.73l28.14,15.74a12,12,0,0,0,9.7.9,116.06,116.06,0,0,0,38-21.47,12,12,0,0,0,4.24-9.1l.14-31.34,27.81-15.81a12,12,0,0,0,5.85-8.11A110.7,110.7,0,0,0,241.86,106.43Zm-22.63,33.18-26.88,15.28a11.94,11.94,0,0,0-4.55,4.59c-.54,1-1.11,1.93-1.7,2.88a12,12,0,0,0-1.83,6.31L184.13,199a91.83,91.83,0,0,1-21.07,11.87l-27.15-15.19a12,12,0,0,0-5.86-1.53h-.29c-1.14,0-2.3,0-3.44,0a12.08,12.08,0,0,0-6.14,1.51L93,210.82A92.27,92.27,0,0,1,71.88,199l-.11-30.24a12,12,0,0,0-1.83-6.32c-.58-.94-1.16-1.91-1.7-2.88A11.92,11.92,0,0,0,63.7,155L36.8,139.63a86.53,86.53,0,0,1,0-23.24l26.88-15.28a12,12,0,0,0,4.55-4.58c.54-1,1.11-1.94,1.7-2.89a12,12,0,0,0,1.83-6.31L71.87,57A91.83,91.83,0,0,1,92.94,45.17l27.15,15.19a11.92,11.92,0,0,0,6.15,1.52c1.14,0,2.3,0,3.44,0a12.08,12.08,0,0,0,6.14-1.51L163,45.18A92.27,92.27,0,0,1,184.12,57l.11,30.24a12,12,0,0,0,1.83,6.32c.58.94,1.16,1.91,1.7,2.88A11.92,11.92,0,0,0,192.3,101l26.9,15.33A86.53,86.53,0,0,1,219.23,139.61Z\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"ti